# A linked WhatsApp session is a LIVE CREDENTIAL — anyone who copies it
# controls the account until the device is unlinked. It appears next to the
# server as soon as anyone links. Never commit it.
server/.wwebjs_auth/
server/.wwebjs_cache/
.wwebjs_auth/
.wwebjs_cache/
.env
node_modules/

# NOTE: `node_modules/` above has no leading slash, so it matches at every depth
# and server/node_modules/ is ignored with it. That is deliberate now, but it was
# not always: puppeteer cannot be bundled, so an earlier layout force-added those
# ~4,200 files to keep a clone runnable for Claude Code install-by-URL.
#
# This repo is distribution-by-download: the deliverable is the .mcpb, which packs
# puppeteer itself, and nobody installs by cloning. So the repo holds the shipped
# artifacts and their history, not a runnable tree. If install-by-URL is wanted
# again, `git add -f server/node_modules` is what brings it back.
